      "id": "hackernews-2026-08-18-degraded-performance-for-multiple-models",
      "title": "Degraded performance for multiple models",
      "summary": "Article URL: https://status.claude.com/incidents/q7txxvbsftgq\nComments URL: https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49348163\nPoints: 138\n# Comments: 121",
      "body": "We are investigating elevated errors on requests to Claude Opus 5. We will provide an update as soon as possible.\nPosted Aug 18, 2026 - 17:12 UTC\nWe are investigating elevated errors on requests to Claude Mythos 5, Claude Fable 5, Claude Opus 5, Claude Sonnet 5, Claude Haiku 4.5, and other Claude models. We will provide an update as soon as possible.\nPosted Aug 18, 2026 - 16:20 UTC\nWe are investigating reports of degraded performance affecting multiple models. We will provide an update as soon as possible.\nPosted Aug 18, 2026 - 16:20 UTC\nThis incident affects: claude.ai, Claude API (api.anthropic.com), Claude Code, and Claude Cowork.",
